### Page 1 of 2 (scanned page: machine OCR, may contain errors)

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:
Mayor Marian Orr, and City Council
FROM:
Sara Vasquez, Purchasing Manager
DATE:
June 5, 2018
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-28-18for furnishing new computers and operating
systemsfor the City of Cheyenne.
We had six(6) bidders respond to this bid, and the bid tab is attached.
The bids were reviewed by Tyler Nelson, and Dustin S walla, and their recommendation is to accept the
lowbid from Dell Marketing L.P of Round Rock, TX in the amount of $37,016.24.
The City is wanting to purchase 56 of the DellO pti Plex3050Micro computers in the amount of
$30,967.44and 10 of the Dell Precision Workstation computers in the amount of $6,048.80.
Funding:
022-26-2615-40-43102(1% Sales Tax 15-18)
```

